title: Grassroots Organizing
subtitle: Field operations and voter registration.
tags: party_action
new-page: true
view-if: organize_timer <= 0
choose-if: funds >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: We need at least 2 funds.
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; organize_timer = 1

= Grassroots Organizing

Votes do not collect themselves. Where should the field program go?

- @everywhere: Fifty-state strategy. (-2 funds)
- @swing: Concentrate on swing states. (-2 funds)
- @registration: Voter registration and protection. (-2 funds)

@everywhere
subtitle: Slow, wide, and good for the whole ticket.
on-arrival: funds -= 2; pop_mod += 0.3; enthusiasm += 2; unity += 1; stability += 1

Organizers appear in counties that have not seen a Democrat in a decade.

@swing
subtitle: Efficient and focused.
on-arrival: funds -= 2; pop_mod += 0.4; enthusiasm += 1

The map is narrow and so is the plan. It works where it works.

@registration
subtitle: Defends the vote itself.
on-arrival: funds -= 2; pop_mod += 0.2; stability += 3; enthusiasm += 2; far_right += 0

Lawyers, volunteers, and drives. Access to the ballot is a democratic good in itself, and a partisan one.
